# Git: the repo-local menu, then a tuicr review of the working tree.
Output docs/media/git.gif
Source demo/tapes/common.tape

Sleep 1s
Ctrl+B
Sleep 200ms
Type "g"
Sleep 2.4s
Down
Sleep 500ms
Up
Sleep 700ms
Type "d"
Sleep 3s
Type@500ms "jjjj"
Sleep 1.5s
# tuicr quits with :q; a bare q only says so.
Type ":q"
Enter
Sleep 2s
